{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Bharata","html":"<article id='thag2.28'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Theragāthā 2.28 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Verses of the Senior Monks 2.28 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Dukanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Twos </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Tatiyavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Chapter Three </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Bharatattheragāthā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Bharata </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Ehi nandaka gacchāma, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Come, Nandaka, let’s go </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>upajjhāyassa santikaṁ; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>to visit our preceptor. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Sīhanādaṁ nadissāma, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>We’ll roar our lion’s roar </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>buddhaseṭṭhassa sammukhā. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>before the best of Buddhas. </span></span></p>\n<p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Yāya no anukampāya, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The sage gave us the going forth </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>amhe pabbājayī muni; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>out of compassion, so we could realize </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>So no attho anuppatto, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>the ending of all fetters—</span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>sabbasaṁyojanakkhayo”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>now we have reached that goal. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>… Bharato thero …. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
